pertise in the department’s three academic programs.\n  * Professors are required to hold at least an assistant professor title and possess industry experience and relevant professional certifications.\n\n#### 4. Faculty Growth Features\n\n  * The COSP Team (Communications, Optoelectronics, and Signal Processing Team) is formed across disciplines.\n--------------------------------------------------------------------------------\n系所成員 | 樹德科技大學 室內設計系暨建築與室內設計碩士班/碩專班 (https://www.idd.stu.edu.tw/%E7%B3%BB%E6%89%80%E6%88%90%E5%93%A1/)\nciteturn312search2 [wordlim: 200] Crawled: last month; 助理教授(技) Assistant Professor\n\n07-6158000-3502 nanice@stu.edu.tw 回到首頁 HOME\n\n# 系所成員\n\n# ChAIR \n\nThe Chair of Interior Design Department\n\n* * *\n\nImage\n\n汪碧芬 / WANG,PI-FEN\n\n副教授 Associate Professor\n\n \n\n# FACULTY \n\nTeacher\n\n* * *\n\nImage\n\n紀順堂 / CHI,SHUN-TANG\n\n助理教授(技) Assistant Professor\n\nImage\n\n周伯丞 / CHOU,PO-CHENG\n\n副教授 Associate Professor\n\nImage\n\n陳逸聰 / CHEN,YI-TSUNG\n\n教授 Professor\n\nImage\n\n宋鴻麒 / SUNG,HUNG-CHI\n\n副校長兼設計學院副院長\n\nImage\n\n黃隆昇 / HUANG,LUNG-SHENG\n\n教授 Professor兼總務長\n\nImage\n\n盧圓華 / LU,YUAN-HUA\n\n特聘教授 Distinguished Professor\n\nImage\n\n李允斐 / LI,YUN-FEI\n\n副教授 Associate Professor\n\nImage\n\n楊博淵 / YANG,PO-YUAN\n\n助理教授 Assistant Professor\n\nImage\n\n汪碧芬 / WANG,PI-FEN\n\n副教授 Associate Professor\n\nImage\n\n許正旺 / HSU,CHENG-WANG\n\n助理教授 Assistant Professor\n\nImage\n\n楊明家 / YOUNG,MIN-CHIA\n\n助理教授 Assistant Professor\n\n \n\n# 行政人員\n\nAdministration Staff\n\n \n\n* * *\n\nImage\n\n陳怡君 / CHEN,YI-CHUN\n\n組員 Administration Staff\n\n \n\n# 兼任\n\nPart-time Professor\n\n* * *\n\nImage\n\n李彥頤 / LI,YEN-I\n\n副教授 Associate Professor\n\nImage\n\n楊詔盛 / YANG,CHAO-SHENG\n\n教師 Teacher\n\nImage\n\n郭美紅 / KUO,MEI-HUNG\n\n教師 Teacher\n\nImage\n\n張博碩 / CHANG,PO-SHUO\n\n教師 Teacher\n\nImage\n\n張福輝 / CHANG,FU-HUI\n\n\n###### 地址 Map\n\n高雄市燕巢區橫山路59號\n\n###### 信箱 Email\n\nnanice@stu.edu.tw\n\n###### 電話 Call\n\n07-6158000 轉 3502\n\n##### 製作人員 Editor\n\n網頁製作 & 美術設計：\n\